          <div data-layer="In Washington, it is already difficult to surprise with the opening of a new institution, but it is still possible. Especially if it is a True Cost project. Here you pay an entrance fee and get meals at cost price." className="InWashingtonItIsAlreadyDifficultToSurpriseWithTheOpeningOfANewInstitutionButItIsStillPossibleEspeciallyIfItIsATrueCostProjectHereYouPayAnEntranceFeeAndGetMealsAtCostPrice self-stretch justify-start text-zinc-500 text-base font-medium font-['Inter'] leading-6">I might be the only one to say this but the camera is a little funky. Hoping it will change with a software update: otherwise, love this phone! Came in great condition</div>
